ing score preview" loading="lazy"><span class="services-programme-overlay"><span class="services-programme-tag">PROGRAMME</span><strong>Small steps, one day at a time.</strong><span>21 days · guided activities <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-5 w-5"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></span></div><div class="services-day-strip"><span class="services-day-number">04 <small>/ 21</small></span><div><strong>A day at a time</strong><span>Read <i></i> Practise <i></i> Reflect</span></div><span class="services-day-check"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-5 w-5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span></div></div></div><div class="reveal reveal-in services-copy" style="transition-delay: 100ms;"><p class="services-mark"><b>02</b><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Daily practice</p><div class="services-heading-row"><h2 id="equip-title">Equip</h2><span class="services-badge">BETA</span></div><h3>Knowing is not the same as changing.</h3><p>Evidence-based programmes designed to support your mental health journey, built on CBT practice and run a day at a time. Short enough to keep up with on a bad week, structured enough to add up over a good month.</p><div class="services-fact"><strong>04</strong><span>guided programmes available now</span></div><button type="button" class="services-action">See the programmes<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></pat